@startuml uml_service
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam dpi 200
skinparam defaultFontName "Microsoft YaHei"
skinparam defaultFontSize 11
skinparam classFontSize 12
skinparam classAttributeFontSize 10
skinparam arrowFontSize 10
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundCorner 6
skinparam linetype polyline
skinparam nodesep 22
skinparam ranksep 28
skinparam classBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam interfaceBackgroundColor #E8F1FB
skinparam abstractBackgroundColor #EAF7EA
skinparam ArrowColor #46536B
skinparam classBorderColor #7C8AA5
hide empty members
hide circle

title （b）服务与交互层：生成、排版、导出与界面

interface ExerciseGenerator <<接口>> {
  +generate(count) : List<Equation>
}

class RandomExerciseGenerator {
  -random : Random
  +generate(count) : List<Equation>
}

interface ExerciseFormatter <<接口>> {
  +format(equations, columns, includeAnswer) : String
}

class ConsoleTableFormatter {
  +format(equations, columns, includeAnswer) : String
}

interface ExerciseExporter <<接口>> {
  +export(equations, target, config) : Path
}

class CsvExporter {
  +export(equations, target, config) : Path
}

class ExportConfig <<record>> {
  +columns : int
  +includeAnswer : boolean
}

class ConsoleApp {
  -generator : ExerciseGenerator
  -exporter : ExerciseExporter
  -formatter : ExerciseFormatter
  +run() : void
  +main(args) : void
}

class InputReader {
  +readInt(prompt, min, max) : int
  +readFileName(prompt, defaultName) : String
}

class InputValidator <<工具类>> {
  +parseBoundedInt(raw, min, max) : int
  +normalizeCsvFileName(raw) : String
}

class Equation <<模型>> {
  +getText() : String
  +getAnswer() : int
}

ExerciseGenerator <|.. RandomExerciseGenerator
ExerciseFormatter <|.. ConsoleTableFormatter
ExerciseExporter <|.. CsvExporter

ConsoleApp *-- InputReader : 构造并持有
ConsoleApp --> ExerciseGenerator : 依赖抽象
ConsoleApp --> ExerciseExporter : 依赖抽象
ConsoleApp --> ExerciseFormatter : 依赖抽象
ConsoleApp ..> ExportConfig : 导出参数
ConsoleApp ..> Equation : 持有题目

InputReader ..> InputValidator : 委托校验
RandomExerciseGenerator ..> Equation : 创建
CsvExporter ..> Equation : 读取题目
CsvExporter ..> ExportConfig : 读取参数
ConsoleTableFormatter ..> Equation : 读取题目

note right of ConsoleApp
  依赖倒转原则（DIP）：
  只依赖三个抽象接口，
  具体实现由 main 注入。
end note

@enduml
